00:28:54.000 --> 00:29:24.000
idea that we evolved this cognitive bias because when something is useful, you should hang on to it because it's useful right now. It's salient in the moment, which supports this idea that a lot of these biases evolved because they were useful. And maybe now they look quirky and unreasonable. But there weren't police forces to come and help you if the person on eBay didn't follow through on their end of the deal back several millennia ago. So you needed to be more careful.
